      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I figured out the issue. VRChat developers added a new object to the heirachy called 'Debug'. My world already had an object with this name, and the GameObject.Find was broken due to the new Debug gameobject introduced to the VRChat client. Renaming my Debug gameobject to something unique, fixed the issue.",
