  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "1. Join world\n\n2. Tag, Trampolines, music, do not work\n\nError:  Assets/Scripts/BagCollider.cs(199,40): VRChat client runtime Udon exception detected!\n\n  An exception occurred during EXTERN to 'UnityEngineGameObject.__get_transform__UnityEngineTransform'.\n\n      Parameter Addresses: 0x0000010D, 0x0000010E\n\n  \n\n  Object reference not set to an instance of an object.\n\n=================\n\nRelevant line of UdonSharp code:\n\ndebug = GameObject.Find(\"Debug\").GetComponent<TextMeshProUGUI>();",
